        non-GAAP financial measures. Reconciliations between the non-GAAP financial measures and the closest GAAP
        financial measures are available on Warner Bros. Discovery's investor relations website at<a href="https://ir.wbd.com/investor-relations/default.aspx"> https://ir.wbd.com </a>.</p>

